# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

strings is project
strings purpose "Slice, search, join, and compare text; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
strings target console
strings version "0.1.0"
strings language refined 1
strings standardLibrary 1
strings allows write console.stdout none
strings requires none
strings includesModule strings
strings entry strings.main
